{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49119","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:53.576843+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Internal reproducer submitted in cl/985921559.","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:13:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/49119#issuecomment-5776267877","id":5776267877,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49119","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABWEraZQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5776267877/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-09-22T12:13:18Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5776267877","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194224583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penumallas1261","id":194224583,"login":"penumallas1261","node_id":"U_kgDOC5Ohxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"The indexing map bug was fixed in https://github.com/openxla/xla/commit/e298fb620b4ffc5e7e90d2f6200e9a25dcde5223\nBut the reproducer also triggers another bug in LLVM, I have https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/225377 open to fix it.","created_at":"2026-09-23T06:11:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/49119#issuecomment-5790007924","id":5790007924,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49119","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABWRyCdA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5790007924/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-09-23T06:11:53Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5790007924","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14309772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/akuegel","id":14309772,"login":"akuegel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzA5Nzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akuegel","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"## Summary\n\nA loop fusion containing a reverse cumsum, a pad/crop, a `dynamic-update-slice` with three traced start indices, and a traced `roll` (concatenate + dynamic-slice) produces wrong results on XLA:GPU (CPU JIT and op-by-op execution seem to be correct). The output-to-operand `IndexingMap` that the GPU emitters compute for the DUS *update* operand has its runtime variables rotated: the roll's start is substituted where the DUS start of dimension 0 belongs, and the three DUS starts are shifted by one slot. The base-operand map of the same fusion is correct. \n\n## Reproducer (GPU shows the bug, CPU is the ref. )\n\n```python\nimport os\nos.environ.setdefault(\"XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_PREALLOCATE\", \"false\")\nimport numpy as np, jax, jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import lax\n\ndef f(x, start0, start1, start2, shift):\n    t = jnp.flip(jnp.cumsum(jnp.flip(x, 2), axis=2, dtype=jnp.int32), 2)     # reverse cumsum\n    t = lax.pad(t, jnp.int32(0), [(-3, -1, 0), (1, 2, 0), (-2, -3, 0)])        # crop/pad -> (29, 10, 11)\n    update = lax.dynamic_slice(t, [0, 0, 0], (14, 4, 7)) * 3 - 1\n    t = lax.dynamic_update_slice(t, update, [start0, start1, start2])          # (20,5,1) clamps to (15,5,1)\n    return jnp.roll(t, shift, axis=1)                                          # traced shift\n\ndef reference(x):\n    t = np.flip(np.cumsum(np.flip(x, 2), axis=2, dtype=np.int64).astype(np.int32), 2)\n    t = np.pad(t[3:32, :, 2:13], ((0, 0), (1, 2), (0, 0)))\n    update = t[:14, :4, :7] * np.int32(3) - np.int32(1)\n    result = t.copy(); result[15:29, 5:9, 1:8] = update\n    return np.roll(result, 5, axis=1)\n\nshape = (33, 7, 16)\nx = (np.arange(np.prod(shape), dtype=np.int64).reshape(shape) * 7919 % 10007 - 5000).astype(np.int32)\nexpected = reference(x)\nargs = (jnp.asarray(x), jnp.int32(20), jnp.int32(5), jnp.int32(1), jnp.int32(5))\nfor platform in (\"gpu\", \"cpu\"):\n    with jax.default_device(jax.devices(platform)[0]):\n        got = np.asarray(jax.jit(f)(*args))\n        with jax.disable_jit():\n            eager = np.asarray(f(*args))\n    bad = np.argwhere(got != expected)\n    print(f\"{platform}: jit={'OK' if not bad.size else 'WRONG'} op-by-op={'OK' if np.array_equal(eager, expected) else 'WRONG'} \"\n          f\"bad={bad.shape[0]} first={bad[0].tolist() if bad.size else None}\")\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\ngpu: jit=WRONG op-by-op=OK bad=748 first=[0, 6, 2]\ncpu: jit=OK op-by-op=OK bad=0 first=None\n```\n\n## Environment\n\n- jax 0.11.2 / jaxlib 0.11.2 (PyPI, 2026-09-17) with the CUDA 13 plugin; also jax 0.12.0.dev20260919 nightly.\n- XLA `645c721` (2026-09-19) for the dumps and `print_indexing` output above.\n- RTX PRO 4000 (compute capability 12.0), driver 595; CPU control on the same host.","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49119/comments","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:34:02Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49119/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/49119","id":5513729778,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":4409976544,"name":"bug","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"008672","default":false,"description":"Awaiting response from openxla-eng","id":4409976552,"name":"stat:awaiting openxla-eng","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm6A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/stat:awaiting%20openxla-eng"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"34E43D","default":false,"description":"XLA on Nvidia GPU","id":4432379563,"name":"NVIDIA-GPU","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABCDC-qw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/NVIDIA-GPU"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"429786","default":false,"description":"XLA on GPU","id":4432380595,"name":"GPU","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABCDDCsw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/GPU"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla